        "fields": {
          "question": "How do I get started?",
          "answer": "- First you take a look at our pricing page and find the plan that best suits you.\n- Then you enter and confirm your email through our sign-up page.\n- Finally you login to the platform, pick your reward type and start customizing the widget."
        }
      },
